'''Power of Darkness''' (暗黒の力, ''Ankoku no Chikara'', '''Dark Power''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]].  It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
"Weaken" Effect UP (M): Weaken duration increases by 20%.

